  "title": "JAMANVAAR — Platform Control Center",
  "text": "PLATFORM CONTROL\nPlatform Owner\nPLATFORM CONTROL CENTER\nExecutive Dashboard\nBUSINESS MANAGEMENT\nRestaurants\nRestaurant Owners\nBranches\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Billing\nSAAS MANAGEMENT\nPlans & Entitlements\nFeature Catalog\nQR Ordering Suite\nWhatsApp Ordering\nJAMAN AI Engine\nMaster Menu Catalog\nActivation Keys\nPayment Gateways\nPlatform Payments\nRestaurant Payouts\nApplications & Releases\nOPERATIONS & MDM\nDevice Fleet / MDM\nSync & Conflict Monitor\nBackups & Recovery\nSystem Telemetry\nStaging Sandboxes\nSECURITY & REPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nAudit Logs\nEmergency Offline Policy\nPlatform Team\nSupport Tickets\nDiagnostics & Support\nPlatform Settings\nACCOUNT\nMy Profile\nPlatform Online\nJAMANVAAR Cloud v1.4.0\nJAMANVAAR PLATFORM\nControl Center\nCtrl+K\nPLATFORM ONLINE\nJ\nJAMANVAAR Super Admin\nPlatform Owner\nLogout\nSaaS Plans\n\nAuthoritative plans governing feature access, pricing, and hardware quotas — never hardcoded in client applications.\n\nCreate Plan\nAll Plans\n5\nActive\n5\nInactive\n0\n5 of 5 plans\nPLAN & TIER\tMONTHLY (₹)\tYEARLY (₹)\tQUOTAS\tFEATURES\tRESTAURANTS\tSTATUS\tACTIONS\n\nJAMANVAAR CORE\nCORE\nRun the restaurant: POS, billing, KOT, menu, inventory, basic reports.\n\t₹420\t₹5,000\t\n1 Br • 5 Dev\n10 Users\n\t15/21 Active\t0\t\nACTIVE\t\nEdit\nDeactivate\n\n\nJAMANVAAR PRO\nPRO\nEverything in Core, plus KDS and the Captain wireless service workflow.\n\t₹580\t₹7,000\t\n5 Br • 20 Dev\n50 Users\n\t21/21 Active\t2\t\nACTIVE\t\nEdit\nDeactivate\n\n\nJAMANVAAR QR\nQR\nEverything in Pro, plus QR table ordering for guest self-service.\n\t₹750\t₹9,000\t\n5 Br • 20 Dev\n50 Users\n\t21/21 Active\t0\t\nACTIVE\t\nEdit\nDeactivate\n\n\nKIOSK STANDARD\nCORE\nSelf-ordering kiosk + Kiosk Admin: menu sync, cart, checkout, basic device management.\n\t₹750\t₹9,000\t\n5 Br • 5 Dev\n10 Users\n\t1/21 Active\t0\t\nACTIVE\t\nEdit\nDeactivate\n\n\nKIOSK PRO\nPRO\nEverything in Kiosk Standard, plus multi-kiosk remote management and advanced analytics.\n\t₹920\t₹11,000\t\n5 Br • 20 Dev\n10 Users\n\t1/21 Active\t1\t\nACTIVE\t\nEdit\nDeactivate\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nCloud Control Active\nENTERPRISE MULTI-TENANT CLOUD CONTROL\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nJAMANVAAR CLOUD PLATFORM CONTROL\n\nSUPER ADMIN\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nCloud Database Connected\n•\nMulti-Tenant Active",
